---
timbrex: 1
strict_tags: true
cast:
  guide: {name: Guide}
narrator: guide
---
// Scene defaults apply to later turns.
[calm] [speed 0.9]
guide: This starts calm and slow. [happy|This phrase is happy. [whisper|This one is also whispered.]] Back to calm.
guide: [speed 1.1] Faster now. [reset speed] Back to scene speed. [sad] Sad now. [reset] Back to calm and slow.
// The comment ended the turn. Repeat the ID for the next speech.
guide: [act "say \"fine\" reluctantly"|I'm fine.] [pause 0.5s] The literal text is \[happy\], a vertical bar \|, and a backslash \\.
// Reset on a scene line clears scene defaults.
[reset]
guide: No scene controls now.
